# Line endings are part of these files' identity: the model, the worklet, and the
# model's licence notice are checked against frozen SHA-256 digests, and the
# runtime fixture is compared byte for byte. A Windows checkout must not rewrite
# any of them, so none of them is left to Git's text-or-binary guess.
* text=auto eol=lf

assets/models/online_amt_streaming.onnx binary
assets/models/online_amt.LICENSE.txt -text
assets/worklets/online-amt-capture.js -text
evals/fixtures/online_amt_runtime/* binary
